  "metadata": {
    "baseline_version": "0.21.14",
    "known_limitations": [
      "Qualified only for three small hand-written linear ONNX graphs. ONNX ReferenceEvaluator verifies export semantics; no claim of complete TASO native graph execution correctness, nonlinear/fused-activation support, convolution, GPU correctness or performance improvement.",
      "Upstream oneDNN build requires the recorded compile-only compatibility changes; batchnorm and convolution affected by compile fixes are not functionally qualified.",
      "Upstream exporter can repeat identical graph input ValueInfo declarations; the check deduplicates only byte-identical declarations and keeps raw exports. No node, tensor, weight or mathematical rewrite is performed by the adapter.",
      "-O3 -DNDEBUG initial build was killed in substitution.cc under host memory pressure. Final build uses -O1 -UNDEBUG; side-effectful assert expressions in unmodified upstream code make assertion retention necessary.",
      "Source helper script consolidates the actually performed build steps; a second clean-room source rebuild was not run. System compiler, CPython headers and standard OS libraries are explicit external build/system requirements."
    ],
